{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_019","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"ComfyUI Manual Installation Guide","location_hint":"paragraph 100","char_start":3545,"char_end":3578,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_020","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"Supports all system types and GPU types (Nvidia, AMD, Intel, Apple Silicon, Ascend NPU, Cambricon MLU)","location_hint":"paragraph 101","char_start":3580,"char_end":3682,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_021","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"Python 3.13 is very well supported and recommended","location_hint":"paragraph 104","char_start":3711,"char_end":3761,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_022","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"Python 3.14 works but some custom nodes may have issues. The free threaded variant works but some dependencies will enable the GIL so it’s not fully supported","location_hint":"paragraph 105","char_start":3763,"char_end":3921,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_023","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"Python 3.12 is a good fallback if you have trouble with some custom node dependencies on 3.13","location_hint":"paragraph 106","char_start":3923,"char_end":4016,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a8c5d541c698_024","source_id":"src_a8c5d541c698","source_hash":"ee1e14bc82ad9ec2a763a7ed0bf487fe4802b73cc38069a27a1954b5b4d223af","text":"For the best experience, use Google Chrome version 143 or later . Earlier versions of Chrome (142 and below) have known issues that can cause visual glitches and performance problems in ComfyUI.","location_hint":"paragraph 109","char_start":4049,"char_end":4243,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.303Z"}
